        </div>
    </details>
    <details class="acc">
        <summary>How do you set up a virtual host for the project? <span class="chev">+</span></summary>
        <div class="acc-body">
            <p class="mb-0">After Ubuntu is installed inside WSL2, you create a virtual host for your project by following the linked virtual-host creation guide.</p>
        </div>
    </details>
